{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"平\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"综合选X：big选X，因为X在S03、S04、S10仍然有明确的大字主线，Y这三屏完全没有大字，关键叙事只能靠小字补；core选X，亲近的幸福、害怕失去、无法保证永远以及最后不再索要保证的完整发展更清楚。small选Y，感受与音乐旁注分层更清晰，补充的身体体验和关系感受也比较丰富；fine选Y，「话到嘴边沉默」「握着的手不自觉收紧」「对视到呼吸都停了」「独处时心头泛酸」等更集中地呈现观众的具体体验，X则有不少内容转向描写音乐本身。concise判平：X跨屏反复回到不敢隐藏喜欢和害怕失去，Y则有若干小字重复大字的焦虑，整体各有取舍；human选X，Y有「紧挨着耳语」「光安静享受已经不够」「颠坏了平衡与自在」「期待终于先得到了满足」等具体搭配或省略问题；load选Y，大块通常只有2至4条，分句自然且逐条出现，X有多屏同时出现5至6个强调点，视线需要来回寻找。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ad9a6e0a-628e-4476-a243-c7055495a204", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T191013213515Z", "elapsed_seconds": 376.094, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T19:16:29.311445+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "79f0fa0bca2bb7bd0487e03751961fa0024ebc2682f3522e2b2ecd91797afc62", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1d